			"notes": "### Compatibility\n\n- Minecraft: `1.17.x`\n- Java: `>=16`\n- Fabric Loader: `>=0.11.3`\n- Fabric API: `*`\n- Cloth Config: `>=5.0`\n\n### Changelog\n\n**Important:** Now requires `fabric-api`.\n\n#### Features\n\n- Fake player entries (created by tab list plugins) corresponding to real players will now be taken into account when displaying ping value.\n- Added a new `enabled` configuration option that controls whether ping nametags are enabled or not.\n- Added a new `toggleEnabledKey` keybinding that toggles ping nametags."
